{"server":"en","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-10_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-10","title":"Beyond Cure","storyCode":"2-10","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-10_end.txt","sourceHash":"f480aee989a7215834674761b5b1c00da73c18bbae803877eddff05ca64b3a52","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十二关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_r"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Nngh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh... Gahh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Aaah-!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Skullshatterer, are you okay?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Tch... What a troublesome bunch!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Skullshatterer, W just said that she's all finished on her end!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"She's successfully retrieved the target."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"W... she won?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"That's right, her assault went very smoothly!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Should we also retreat?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Send a signal to Talulah."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Roger!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"...We're pulling back."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmph. Rhodes Island cowards..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"The next time we meet... will be at your execution."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Reunion... is retreating?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"They're retreating very rapidly. Something must have changed with their plans."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Despite all that talk, they sure know how to run away."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Something... doesn't feel right."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Liskarm","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you saying..."},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"We weren't their objective in the first place...","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"That they were only here to stall us...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"If that's the case..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh no, the L.G.D. is in trouble!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...We have to help Madam Ch'en right now!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Franka, call the recon squad back immediately!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Liskarm, try to get in touch with Madam Ch'en!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Where's the Special Operations Division? Their reinforcements are supposed to be here by now!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"We were just notified that they've been stalled by Reunion...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"How's that possible? Reunion is nothing more than a gang of unruly thugs!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"...And they were only facing... a single enemy..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ep02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Unless..."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["Ch'en"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["L.G.D. Agent"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["Reunion Member"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["Franka"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["Liskarm"]},{"speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","aliases":["Skullshatterer"]}]}
